<http://data.silknow.org/object/78c52c1a-0303-3b4d-9b0e-91310d02aec1/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Piece, irregular rectangle, made of three pieces, sewn together. Chocolate brown ribbed taffeta ground brocaded with polychrome silks. Pattern shows a plinth supporting an urn containing strawberries; at left of plinth, sheep graze and drink from a pool; large-scale leaves and flowering branches issue from the scene and fill interspaces. A few brocading yarns rubbed, broken loose from ground."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/78c52c1a-0303-3b4d-9b0e-91310d02aec1> .

